                       (?.let [r77 Bit r76 Bit r75 Bit r74 Bit r73 Bit r72 Bit r71 Bit r70 Bit
                               r67 Bit r66 Bit r65 Bit r64 Bit r63 Bit r62 Bit r61 Bit r60 Bit
