                               r17 Bit r16 Bit r15 Bit r14 Bit r13 Bit r12 Bit r11 Bit r10 Bit
                               r07 Bit r06 Bit r05 Bit r04 Bit r03 Bit r02 Bit r01 Bit r00 Bit

                               s77 Bit s76 Bit s75 Bit s74 Bit s73 Bit s72 Bit s71 Bit s70 Bit
