                               s17 Bit s16 Bit s15 Bit s14 Bit s13 Bit s12 Bit s11 Bit s10 Bit
                               s07 Bit s06 Bit s05 Bit s04 Bit s03 Bit s02 Bit s01 Bit s00 Bit]
                              (?.= (|type|)
                                   (,extension (/.new r77 r76 r75 r74 r73 r72 r71 r70
                                                      r67 r66 r65 r64 r63 r62 r61 r60
                                                      r57 r56 r55 r54 r53 r52 r51 r50
